[stderr] | --- | --- | --- | --- |
[stderr] | ADJ-01 | Select, C=`france` | `france` | accepted / `canonical_match` |
[stderr] | ADJ-02 | Select, C=`france` | `argentina` | rejected / `incorrect_option` |
[stderr] | ADJ-03 | Select, C=`france` | empty | rejected / `blank` |
[stderr] | ADJ-04 | Select, C=`france` | `France` | rejected / `unknown_option_id` |
[stderr] | ADJ-05 | Select, C=`france` | `fra` | rejected / `unknown_option_id` |
[stderr] | ADJ-06 | True/false, C=`true` | `true` | accepted / `canonical_match` |
